# CityChecker AI context

Before non-trivial changes, read the relevant file under **`docs/ai/`**:

| Topic | File |
|-------|------|
| Index | `docs/ai/README.md` |
| Product / layout | `docs/ai/00-overview.md` |
| How to change code | `docs/ai/01-conventions.md` |
| API / DB / auth | `docs/ai/02-architecture.md` |
| Map / sheet / modes | `docs/ai/03-frontend.md` |
| Environment layer | `docs/ai/04-environment.md` |
| Imports | `docs/ai/05-data-imports.md` |
| Deploy / backup / SSH | `docs/ai/06-ops.md` |
| Gotchas | `docs/ai/07-gotchas.md` |

Hard rules (always):

- Minimal diff; English in code; no commit/push unless asked
- Never commit or print `.env` secrets / `SSH_PASSWORD`
- JWT in `sessionStorage` (`cc_id_token`); city lock in `localStorage` (`cc_city_id`)
- District IDs unstable across re-import — restore Postgres with user data
- Do not call `bringToFront` on `L.LayerGroup`; env load uses `envLoadGen`, not `mapAbort`
- After SPA JS changes: bump `app.js?v=` in `index.html`
- Humans: `README.md` + `docs/`; AI detail: `docs/ai/`

Root `AGENTS.md` is a short pointer only.
